        <p>Everton sits on the ridge above Liverpool city centre. The water tower is the local landmark. The area has changed more than any other part of Liverpool in the last decade. L5 property values are up 75% in five years.</p>

        <p>The new Everton FC stadium at Bramley-Moore Dock opened for the 2025/26 season. That's £5.5 billion of waterfront work around it. Project Jennifer on Great Homer Street brought a new district centre with Sainsbury's, B&M and the Greatie Market. The housing stock is changing too.</p>

