        <p>The buy-to-let market is the biggest in the city. L5 has the highest yield at 7.5%. That means lots of landlords, lots of HMOs, lots of students and healthcare workers renting near the three universities and Royal Liverpool Hospital. We cover them all at fixed rates.</p>
